(
    title: "Atlantis",
    developer: Some("Dennis Koble"),
    description: Some("Defend the undersea city of Atlantis from the Gorgon fleet. Waves of enemy ships streak across the sky at three heights while you man three ground batteries — two angled sentry posts and a central command post that fires straight up — and you must pick the gun that matches each ship\'s altitude. Every Gorgon that slips past bombards one of Atlantis\'s installations, and when the last one falls the city is lost. A lone Atlantean ship survives to escape to Imagic\'s Cosmic Ark."),
